            <value>Emergency Symptoms During Triage</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_triage_emergency_protocol:label">
            <value>If you have not already, you will treat and refer the patient. If they have been treated and referred, use this form to record information and notes.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_pneumonia_pink:label">
            <value>Severe Pneumonia</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_pneumonia_pink_protocol:label">
            <value>You will administer urgent intramuscular medication and refer immediately to the hospital.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_pneumonia_yellow:label">
            <value>Pneumonia</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_pneumonia_yellow_protocol:label">
            <value>You will prescribe oral antibiotics, fever management, and monitor warning signs.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_flu_like_syndrome:label">
            <value>Flu-Like Syndrome</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_flu_like_syndrome_protocol:label">
            <value>You will provide supportive care, rest and hydration advice, and symptom relief.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_tonsillitis:label">
            <value>Tonsillitis</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_tonsillitis_protocol:label">
            <value>You will prescribe antibiotics, administer fever relief, and schedule follow-up.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_gastritis:label">
            <value>Gastritis</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_gastritis_protocol:label">
            <value>You will provide oral rehydration, manage symptoms, and refer urgently if vomiting persists.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_dehydration:label">
            <value>Dehydration</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_dehydration_protocol:label">
            <value>You will administer oral rehydration salts (ORS) and provide hydration counseling.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_dysentery:label">
            <value>Bacterial or Parasitic Dysentery</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_dysentery_protocol:label">
            <value>You will prescribe antimicrobial treatment, provide hydration, and advise clinic return if no improvement.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_impetigo:label">
            <value>Impetigo or Folliculitis</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_impetigo_protocol:label">
            <value>You will provide antiseptic skin care, apply topical treatment, and prescribe antibiotics if severe.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_ring_worm:label">
            <value>Ringworm (Tinea)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_ring_worm_protocol:label">
            <value>You will provide topical antifungal cream, oral antifungal if extensive, and hygiene counseling.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_scabies:label">
            <value>Scabies</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_scabies_protocol:label">
            <value>You will provide anti-itch lotion, antiparasitic lotion, and counsel household contact treatment.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_uti:label">
            <value>Urinary Tract Infection</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_uti_protocol:label">
            <value>You will prescribe antibiotics and provide hydration and hygiene counseling.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_glomerulonephritis:label">
            <value>Risk of Glomerulonephritis</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_glomerulonephritis_protocol:label">
            <value>You will administer emergency medication and refer immediately to the hospital.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_syphilis:label">
            <value>Risk of Syphilis (Genital Ulcer)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_syphilis_protocol:label">
            <value>You will administer injectable antibiotic slowly, treat sexual partners, and provide safe sex counseling.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_other_std:label">
            <value>Risk of Other STD (Urethral/Vaginal Discharge)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_other_std_protocol:label">
            <value>You will provide syndromic oral antibiotic treatment, treat sexual partners, and counsel on prevention.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_anemia:label">
            <value>Moderate Anemia</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_anemia_protocol:label">
            <value>You will prescribe iron folic acid supplements, deworming medication, and provide dietary counseling.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_urgent_ref:label">
            <value>Urgent / Emergency Referral Required</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_urgent_ref_protocol:label">
            <value>You will monitor vital signs and initiate immediate emergency hospital transfer.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_no_condition:label">
            <value>No Specific Medical Action Required</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/summary_header/res_no_condition_protocol:label">
            <value>You may provide routine health education, nutritional guidance, and wellness counseling.</value>
          </text>
