            <value>Protocol:
- Administer Metamizol 500mg/mL IM injection based on weight
- Refer URGENTLY to hospital immediately</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_pneumonia_severe/pneu_sev_counseling:label">
            <value>Counseling:
- Warn parent that immediate hospital evaluation is critical for the child's life
- Keep patient calm and warm during transport</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_pneumonia_severe/confirm_metamizol_inj:label">
