            <value>The patient has Pneumonia</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_pneumonia/pneu_yellow_protocol:label">
            <value>Protocol:
- Distribute 21 Amoxycilline 500mg tablets to be taken 3 times daily for 7 days
- Distribute Acetaminophen 500mg tablets based on weight to be taken 3 times daily for 3 days</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_pneumonia/pneu_yellow_counseling:label">
            <value>Counseling:
- Complete the full 7-day course of antibiotics even if feeling better
- Go to the hospital if fever does not go down or respiratory distress worsens
- Drink plenty of liquids (soup, juice, treated water)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_pneumonia/confirm_amoxycillin_500mg_pneu:label">
            <value>Did you distribute 21 Amoxycilline 500mg?</value>
          </text>
