          <text id="/data/grp_flu_like/flu_notification:label">
            <value>The patient has Flu-Like Syndrome</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_flu_like/flu_protocol:label">
            <value>Protocol:
- Distribute anti-flu supportive care medication
- If green nasal discharge is present, distribute 15 Amoxicillin 500mg tablets (taken 3 times daily for 5 days)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_flu_like/flu_counseling:label">
            <value>Counseling:
- Get adequate rest and drink plenty of fluids
- Use saline nasal drops to clear nasal passages
- Watch out for danger signs: high fever and breathing difficulty</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_flu_like/flu_green_nasal_discharge:label">
            <value>Does the youth have green nasal discharge?</value>
