          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_gastritis/gastritis_notification:label">
            <value>The patient has Gastritis</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_gastritis/gastritis_protocol:label">
            <value>Protocol:
- Administer 1 ORS packet for rehydration
- Distribute 1 bottle Litacid Gel 20cc (1-2 tbsp 3 times daily between meals and before bed)
- Refer urgently if vomiting is intractable or contains blood</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_gastritis/gastritis_counseling:label">
            <value>Counseling:
- Eat frequent small meals; avoid spicy, fried, salty, or acidic foods
- Wash hands with soap before meals and after latrine use
- Return to clinic if symptoms worsen</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_gastritis/confirm_litacid_gel_gastritis:label">
