          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_dehydration/dehydration_protocol:label">
            <value>Protocol:
- Administer on-site ORS rehydration
- Distribute 3 packets of ORS for home therapy
- Distribute 10 Zinc 20mg tablets to be taken 1 tablet daily for 10 days</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_dehydration/dehydration_counseling:label">
