            <value>The patient has Dysentery</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_dysentery/dysentery_protocol:label">
            <value>Protocol:
- Distribute Ciprofloxacin 500mg tablets based on weight twice daily for 3 days (&lt;35kg: 3 tablets; &gt;=35kg: 6 tablets)
- Administer 1 ORS packet for rehydration</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_dysentery/dysentery_counseling:label">
            <value>Counseling:
- Maintain hydration with plenty of clean treated fluids
- Go to the hospital if condition does not improve within 48 hours
- Wash hands with soap and water after defecation and before eating</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/grp_dysentery/confirm_cipro_dysentery:label">
